<title>USA: Quantum cuts solid state disk prices.</title>
<headline>Quantum cuts solid state disk prices.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quantum Corp announced Monday across-the-board price reductions for its ESP 3000 and ESP 5000 solid state disk families, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The reductions, which apply both to Quantum's OEM and distribution channels, range from 10 to 40 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Quantum designs, manufactures and markets storage products.</p>
</text>
